Author: F. Aragon <francisco.aragon@advantech.de>
Date:   Thu Apr 17 18:45:03 2025 +0200

    add support for rom-5720 2G (imx8mq)

    MP: pass
    MQ: issues with suspend to RAM, external watchdog

    Changes from:
    - https://github.com/ADVANTECH-Corp/uboot-imx - imx8LBVD0075 / adv_v2023.04_6.1.22-2.0.0
         lpddr4_timing_rom5720a1_2G.c
         lpddr4_timing_b0.c
    - https://github.com/ADVANTECH-Corp/linux-imx.git - imx8LBVD0075
         imx8mq-rom5720-a1.dts as rom5721-db5901.dts
    - https://github.com/nxp-imx/uboot-imx - lf_v2024.04
         recipes-bsp/u-boot/u-boot-imx/rom5720-db5901/0001-minimal-differences.patch
            From changes in files:
            arch/arm/dts/imx8mq-evk.dts
            board/nxp/imx8mq_evk/Makefile
            include/configs/imx8mq_evk.h

Updates:
	Date:	Wed Oct 28 19:50:00 2026 +0100

	    ecu150 and rom5720 unification refactor

